#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:5
#: 1d8b59fcbb52478480c269aff641e419 1f74abe87fb04c8483ae27eb8f38682b
#: 2dcba3f30a5542158627901488b4d3cd 79ebd4d331a7410a8adda495c27089d9
#: a5cf4efbc9b4433fb3e93d1e9e5ee177
msgid "Nanoradar NRA 24"
msgstr "Nanoradar NRA 24"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:8
#: 0a148f4bb1084e728a72b63f3a5c12e0 6dd8615863504163bfe5ff53a4667ea3
#: 88e43ee4a8494577b8c91066d31e8a19 90391019b8594641b0257fe6a60e88bf
#: a4017cfe3c4f4c35a1493489901434da
msgid ""
"Support for this sensor is available in firmware versions 4.5 and later."
msgstr "固件 4.5 及更高版本支持此传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:10
#: 0bee2faf512947019be244b0aee5fc2e 16bc27e358a8436db18f7919afdc80ca
#: 32c0e22d7504467ea1badd99758ae911 a4f0aaf46fa6405cab1a61fbd774f7d5
#: c51cf4a78bd64edd8d6df0ae51e5ea84
msgid ""
"The `NRA24 <http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/372.html>`__ is K-band "
"radar commonly used for detecting height above terrain in all-weather "
"conditions.Currently, only connection via CAN is supported for more than one"
" NRA24 module. Serial (UART) versions of this Radar have only been tested "
"with a single NRA24 module."
msgstr ""
"`NRA24 <http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/372.html>`__ 是 K "
"频段雷达，常用于全天候地形高度探测。目前，多个 NRA24 模块的连接仅支持 CAN 接口。串口（UART）版本仅经过单个 NRA24 模块的测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:14
#: 13a8db7f7ea449e2a1521f775f1f8cbb 620941d0232c47bebd7af8641438854a
#: 656fc5edeb9d4813acef6a0cbfe6c746 8b8213f2008546118cea03eeb47de1bd
#: 910eb76e7b964c5eb93a9828a272d068
msgid "Connecting via CAN"
msgstr "通过 CAN 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:16
#: 33ed79085231415a8a2668da8f32001c 5cee958e38454153b7e442994e74e74f
#: 8adc150c2f5c442caacc0037b51d3f15 ad09254846214f1884253c992767ec64
#: d60dc99732bb47399319681f0cffb137
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NSM Software. In particular set the \"ID\" to a"
" unique number if planning to use multiple NRA24 on a single CAN bus. You "
"can also set the bitrate from the software."
msgstr "通过 NSM 软件配置传感器。若计划在同一 CAN 总线上使用多个 NRA24，请将「ID」设置为唯一编号。也可通过软件设置波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:19
#: 1c4b577f751543f180b1f460b61c8a60 653176b0990f40359a1c88bef4116844
#: d0634c23d7e84c0ca316f92af5a59628 eaf398f3d44c4449b0b680213c3b7519
#: fde23ad7a9e94cc9bbc5fe243c94d4cc
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently support the same type CAN rangefinders "
"connected to different CAN ports. If you would like to use multiple CAN "
"rangefinders together, connect them to the same bus."
msgstr "ArduPilot 目前不支持将同类 CAN 测距仪连接至不同 CAN 接口。若需同时使用多个 CAN 测距仪，请将它们连接至同一总线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:23
#: 12a537384959480c851408c8203afc31 2077b60e9b96428badf2ed73e237b3b7
#: 8ce2d44d18b644ef85f4a2ec2db21d36 b016ebf773d64d19b4c071475aa9f84c
#: b901be175e0d4867828d48928f678371
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:24
#: 04fa406acc92419ab3d1ef9a5ffe159c 496993e3f17d4e3f8d337683de91ba41
#: 50933391954f4ef3800bcb32084d7c0c b8d3bee49dfc4c67a75201ea758ca057
#: d8dd4ca0b89f49199a196811d4413bff
msgid ""
"Setup the sensor through the NSM tools provided by the manufacturer. More "
"details can be found `here "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/download/id/467.html>`__. Set the \"ID\" to a "
"unique number if planning to use multiple NRA24 on a single CAN bus. You can"
" also set the bitrate from the software to match the CAN bus bitrate (500000"
" is recommended)."
msgstr ""
"通过制造商提供的 NSM 工具配置传感器，详情可在 `此处 "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/File/download/id/467.html>`__ 获取。若计划在同一 CAN 总线上使用多个 "
"NRA24，请将「ID」设置为唯一编号。也可通过软件设置波特率以匹配 CAN 总线波特率（推荐 500000）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:26
#: 32947062b6d443b5a9de7aa34fc45c80 5baf487bac27462c94d0efe6428f3086
#: 91cef7406cb045e9b557359d101b193a 9e235693efa44d2f9235d3b29d080826
#: df36ecdafa274c2b96200051bc1d375e
msgid ""
"For a serial connection you can use any spare CAN port. Since this is not a "
"DroneCAN based sensor, you will not be able to use the connected port with "
"any other sensor. The diagram below shows how to connect to CAN2."
msgstr ""
"串口连接可使用任意空闲 CAN 接口。由于该传感器不基于 DroneCAN，所连接的接口将无法与其他传感器共用。下图展示了连接至 CAN2 的方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:31
#: 3bde4fa4253d4121ba95e14d568b089b 47e9120ab867465586b44a22b32c90a6
#: 69f4f21e45dc4a64838155779ee1c4c4 732daa288c004522b2cb97113f267f70
#: 74c78d55cbd94e9c87439169f6da1fbf
msgid "Set the following parameters"
msgstr "设置以下参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:33
#: 197c53b29e5145578c232b8c6c819716 576b5888d5384605aba8e6f74f6b194d
#: bae494d77fd54122b8fd436c61345bc3 bf326f4ff5ce442b99a32dc7181321c9
#: f8d1aa2517684435aeac15d7ff710243
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 2 (to enable the second CAN driver)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_DRIVER <CAN_P2_DRIVER>` = 2（启用第二 CAN 驱动器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:34
#: f819c20f2cf04c0b8939ea91166180d3
msgid ""
":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE <CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 500000 (or as set in NSM tools)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_P2_BITRATE <CAN_P2_BITRATE>` = 500000（或与 NSM 工具中设置一致）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:35
#: 7a31ab09209c4da3905bf169ad4ee011
msgid ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL <CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14 (NanoRadar)"
msgstr ":ref:`CAN_D2_PROTOCOL <CAN_D2_PROTOCOL>` = 14（NanoRadar）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:36
#: 06586adaabaf4ad4b0a9ad6bcd4a24d8 5de5a122c7a9429395b23acdb907f089
#: 76be2911b98f44c89d1f0d3da539453a 902cccb391694b20a39c88374669fc39
#: abb889d0643f4f658674f9beec71aca2
