":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 39 (NRA-24). Reboot after setting this."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 39（NRA-24），设置后重启。"

