#: 9a6929c4635242e283f731b6a5c1f0e3 bcac3bbce8544c39a632e3285cf75177
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 190 (i.e. 200m max range with 10m buffer)"
