msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_RECV_ID <RNGFND1_RECV_ID>` = 传感器 ID（设为 0 可接受所有 CAN ID 的距离数据）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:43
#: 5cb30156c1664ce2ba92be524d71af36 7006dba7e0b2480b8328bf37ea05d35c
#: b827c65f824842ac8c9040893f7eb149 c1b87eaaeae249cba60441dd4bf777ca
#: f139fdc45d5b448fbd071406e582d09f
