#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:45
#: 39818f11d70343678504e6718cb5a99f 3d4c8cc7462d41fbb6b382a65759289a
#: 78c90fff80214258bd04fa6075b056fd d5259ef294d24f7295697ebe7f507694
#: e9a80a0cfb6648c5b462989fb529ca52
msgid ""
"This is the recommended configuration by Nanoradar given `here "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/495.html>`__, but ArduPilot has "
"not verified that all operational edge cases are satisfied using the USD-1 "
"driver. Caution is advised."
msgstr ""
"这是 Nanoradar 推荐的配置（见 `此处 "
"<http://en.nanoradar.cn/Article/detail/id/495.html>`__），但 ArduPilot 尚未验证使用 "
"USD-1 驱动时所有边界情况均满足要求。建议谨慎使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:50
#: 04c259566f59439c98792e2c9ec69576 41b6b889cbae40228fdf5220f4f9481a
