":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 9 (which translates to "
"Rangefinder)"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 9（即测距仪协议）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-nra24.rst:54
#: 0d01eea62d8c411299e8edec4044d9e7 96506afccbbd46329cd89ccd1bf218b2
#: d68ae28a82d54e6fb8657abe70b7b00d f1333197267d44ac95f1ea562e421a22
#: fd12a37993aa4bf5a4cf6a218c8f9820
